    "readme_description": "Given an integer `n` represented as a string, return *the smallest **good base** of* `n`.\n\nWe call `k >= 2` a **good base** of `n`, if all digits of `n` base `k` are `1`'s.",
    "_readme_examples": {
        "list": [
