                "content": "```\nInput: n = \"4681\"\nOutput: \"8\"\nExplanation: 4681 base 8 is 11111.\n```"
            },
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: n = \"1000000000000000000\"\nOutput: \"999999999999999999\"\nExplanation: 1000000000000000000 base 999999999999999999 is 11.\n```"
            }
        ]
    },
